走回了南宫连的身边，哼，给她下药是吗？缺女人是吗？那她就连做风流鬼的机会都不给他，想到这里，手起刀落，直接将他的**砍了下来，软趴趴的一坨，真是恶心死了！把那恶心的东西用匕首摆放在他的手里，战轻狂都不想再看一眼，转身就走。明天她等着看南宫家的“笑话”。而下一个目标，冯家，冯翔。闪身进到厨房，填饱肚子，又休息一下，天微微亮，战轻狂又翻出院子，向着大街上走去，这身衣服没办法穿了。稀稀落落的星星点缀着天空，天还没大亮，街上的许多小贩已经开始了一天的生计。从成衣铺“买”了一套衣服和一件黑色的大斗篷，战轻狂向着这里有名的“万花楼”走去。而她所谓的买，只是衣服她拿走了，晶币留在柜台上了，没看见的人，怕是以为遇见鬼了。万花楼是湘城最大的妓院，从南宫轻狂的记忆力，南宫连曾多次威胁她，要把她卖到这里来，而且这里也是那些人最喜欢的地方，所谓，知己知彼，百战不殆，比灵力，比修为，她是比不过，可是，若论暗杀，谁也不是她的对手。在万花楼的对面街角处，战轻狂守株待兔，仔细观察着，果然，刚过晌午，冯翔就带着家丁来了，呵，真是不知人间疾苦的大少爷啊！拿着他老爹的钱，穿的光鲜亮丽的，整天不务正业，只知道吃喝嫖赌。看着冯翔一步三摇的进去了，战轻狂露出嗜血的笑容，冯大少，好好享受你生命中最后的一个下午吧！因为你已经不会再看到明天的太阳了。耐心，她有的是，以前做家族任务时，哪怕不吃不喝，一动不动，她都能坚持三天三夜，更别说这小小的等待了。狩猎前的等待是最令人激动，热血沸腾的。华灯初上，家丁们搀扶着冯翔出来了。或许是家丁的动作惹他不快了，他甩开家丁，又斥责了几句，自己晃晃悠悠的往回走。冯府在湘城的的中央位置，是商贾之家，而家里只有这么个唯一的儿子，自然是百般宠溺，才使他养成这种嚣张跋扈的性子。眼看着离冯府大门不远，战轻狂躲进巷子里，查探好退路，等着猎物落网。跌跌撞撞的走到大门口，冯翔就被脚下扔过来的石子吸引了注意力，谁这么大胆子，敢挡了他回家的路，扫视周围，就发现东边的巷口有个人影，刚想破口大骂，然而当看清了是谁，怒吼又咽了回去，怎么会是她？南宫家的废物，前几天让他跑了，如今自己送上门了，刚想带领家丁走过去，却被她那小鹿般懵懂纯真的样子惊艳了一把，见她怯怯的眼神扫了家丁一下，又水汪汪的看着他，直看得他小心肝儿扑通扑通乱跳。轻咳了一声，冯翔止住家丁的脚步，整理一下衣裳，潇洒的走到巷子里。然而刚要追上，小美人就不见了，他诧异的停下了，又听见铜铃般的笑声，美人正在拐角那偷偷的看着自己，小脸红扑扑的，于是，心血**的他觉得偶尔玩一次你追我赶的游戏也是个乐趣，匆匆跟上的美人的脚步。殊不知他踏上了一条死亡之路，正一步一步的将自己的命玩丢了。疲累的冯翔有些不耐烦了，到底有完没完了？刚想将小美人喊出来，却发现他再也说不出话了，什么时候他的脖子可以转到后边，看见身后的人呢？瘫倒在地时，冯翔死不瞑目，眼前一脸冰霜的人是自己刚才看到的娇羞的少女吗？为什么，这是为什么？“想知道为什么？”晚风夹杂着少女微凉的声音，使他周身泛起凉意。“……”“当然是用你的死祭奠南宫轻狂了，第一个是南宫连，第二个是你，下一个，会是谁呢？”少女歪着头，笑的顾盼生辉。祭奠？南宫轻狂死了，那么眼前的是谁？还有，南宫连，难道他已经死了吗？不会的，不会的，开什么玩笑，这是一场梦，一定是梦！看着他眼中失去光泽，不敢置信的脸，战轻狂嗤笑一下，以为是在做梦？那好啊，这辈子都别想醒过来。拿出匕首，如法炮制，做完这一切，战轻狂闪身离开，很久才听到惊吼声。第二日，整个湘城沸腾了。“听说了吗？听说了吗？南宫家的南宫连，冯家的冯翔一夜惨死，手段很是毒辣呢！”“我知道，我知道，听说两人死法都一样…”“你们知道什么啊，我二舅的表姐的侄子的婶娘在南宫家当差，听说他们一下就被人扭断了喉咙，死后还把那个给割下来，放在他们自己手里，那叫一个诡异哦！”说着，手比划了一个姿势。“城主大人现在很是恼火呢，吩咐严查呢！”“我看，一定是他们得罪什么人了…”“我猜啊，一定是个惩恶扬善的强者，看不惯他们平日欺男霸女，为祸一方…”“不对，不对，要我说啊，肯定是惹到什么密宗妖女了，没看他们被割下那个了吗…”“……”坐在他们旁边的战轻狂有些好笑，果然有人的地方就有江湖，有江湖的地方就少不了八卦，要是让他们知道，两起案件的凶手就在旁边，细细的品着茶，不知道他们有什么感想。“要我说啊，那是他们罪有应得！”“可不是吗？”“就是，就是，这一比较，就看出好坏了，你看看宋家的宋如风，那才是正人君子呢！和他们这些为非作歹的可不一样。”“是呢，许多百姓都受过他的帮助呢！”“幸好前日他出城了，万一凶手要是个杀人狂魔，那宋公子不是遭殃了？”“怎么会？宋公子文韬武略样样精通，还是中级灵师，谁会是他的对手呢？”“是啊，佳公子的称号不是白来的，有哪个人敢这样单枪匹马的为家族生意奔波，也就是他才有这胆量。”“……”宋如风？佳公子？呸，就是一个披着人皮的狼，当之无愧的伪君子，那几个人里凡事都是以他为首，听他号令，人前一套，背后一套，她最看不起的就是这样的人。不过，出城了？也好，那就有时间设下埋伏了，中级灵师不好对付啊！可是，她战轻狂是什么人？一点小困难就想把她打到，绝不可能，一个个的谁都别想跑，君子是吧！那她就看看君子和别人有什么不一样。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 4 The way to die is the same (1) It was just getting dark, Zhan Qingkuang sneaked back to Xiangcheng, arrived at Nangong's house, slipped in unnoticed from the low wall in the courtyard, walked to Nangonglian's door, saw the darkness in the house, climbed through the window and entered. The Nangong family in Xiangcheng is just a little-known side branch of the Nangong family. Nangong, even his father, is just a side branch of a side branch, let alone the son of a concubine. This Nangong Lian had disliked her since she was a child, and he often bullied her when she grew older. In recent years, he relied on his spiritual power to get together with some like-minded rich kids. It was because of his frivolous intimidation of Nangong a few days ago that that scene happened. Those who come out to fool around will have to pay back sooner or later! Zhan Qingkuang laid an ambush in the house, and all he had to do was wait for the fish to take the bait. When the sound of Bangbang's wake-up call came, there were finally some chaotic footsteps in the courtyard. \"Master Lian, oh, be careful if you fall, I will help you...\" The young man kept flattering you, and you can imagine his nodding and hunched face. \"Stop talking nonsense, I'm happy today...hiccup...happy...\" \"Yes, yes, look at your bad mouth, please be careful...\" The moonlight shines into the room along the open door, and the young man helps Nangong Lian lie on the bed, trying hard to ignore the strong smell of powder and wine. Neither of them noticed that there was another person in the room. \"Go, go, you are an eyesore in front of me, hiccup... I'll reward you, get out of here, get out of here...\" Nangong Lian took out two crystal coins from his purse and dismissed the boy impatiently. \"Yes, yes, get out of here right now. Master Lian, please have a good rest.\" Holding the crystal coin in his hand, the young man smiled from ear to ear and left happily, not forgetting to close the door before leaving. When the servant walked away, Zhan Qingkuang appeared. The bright white moonlight reflected her cold eyes. She looked at the man who kept mumbling on the bed and sneered silently. He was a scum. Killing him would really dirty his hands! However, now that she has no money or power, she can only do it herself and reluctantly send him to hell! He gently approached the bed tent, and before Nangong Lian could react, he heard a click and his neck was broken. His wide eyes were full of shock and disbelief, but no matter how unwilling he was, he remained silent and lowered his head. Maybe he will never understand until his death, why he died at the hands of that cowardly loser who allowed him to bully him? Wiping his hands with the bed tent, Zhan Qingkuang curled his lips in disgust and began to look at the room. In the past, Nangong Qingkuang only passed by this yard and never entered the house. From what he looked at, it was just like this, with vulgar colors and tasteless placement. In other words, the dagger hanging on the wall was worthy of her taking a second look, and there were some crystal coins. After looking at it, Zhan Qingkuang took the dagger in his hand and walked back to Nangong Lian. Humph, drugged her, right? Lack of women? Then she didn't even give him the chance to be a romantic ghost. Thinking of this, she raised the knife and cut off his penis directly. It was a soft lump. It was really disgusting! Putting the disgusting thing in his hand with a dagger, Zhan Qingkuang didn't want to look at it again, so he turned around and left. She will wait to see the Nangong family's \"joke\" tomorrow. The next target is the Feng family, Feng Xiang. He sneaked into the kitchen, filled his stomach, and took a rest. The sky was slightly bright, and Zhan Qingkuang walked out of the yard again and walked toward the street. He couldn't wear these clothes anymore. Scattered stars dotted the sky. Before dawn, many vendors on the street had already started their day's work. After \"bought\" a set of clothes and a large black cloak from a ready-made clothing store, Zhan Qingkuang walked towards the famous \"Wanhua Building\" here. And what she meant by buying was that she took away the clothes and left the crystal coins on the counter. People who didn't see it might think they saw a ghost. Wanhualou is the largest brothel in Xiangcheng. From Nangong's frivolous memory, Nangonglian has threatened her many times to sell her here, and this is also the favorite place of those people. As the saying goes, know yourself and the enemy, and you can fight through a hundred battles. She is no match for spiritual power and cultivation. However, when it comes to assassination, no one is her opponent. At the corner opposite Wanhua Building, Zhan Qingkuang waited and observed carefully. Sure enough, just after noon, Feng Xiang came with his servants. Ha, what a young master who doesn't know the sufferings of the world! He took his father's money, dressed in bright clothes, and did not do his job all day long. He only knew how to eat, drink, and gamble. Seeing Feng Xiang go in with three steps, Zhan Qingkuang showed a bloodthirsty smile, Mr. Feng, enjoy the last afternoon of your life! Because you will never see the sun tomorrow again. She has a lot of patience. When she was doing family tasks in the past, she could persist for three days and three nights even if she didn't eat, drink or move, let alone this little wait. The waiting before the hunt is the most exciting and exciting. When the lanterns first came on, the servants helped Feng Xiang out. Perhaps the servant's actions made him unhappy. He shook the servant away, scolded him a few more times, and walked back unsteadily. The Feng Mansion was located in the center of Xiangcheng and was the home of merchants. As the only son in the family, he was naturally pampered in every possible way, which made him develop such an arrogant and domineering temperament. Seeing that he was not far from the gate of Feng Mansion, Zhan Qingkuang hid in the alley, scouted out an escape route, and waited for his prey to be caught. Stumbling to the gate, Feng Xiang was attracted by the stones thrown under his feet. Who was so bold as to block his way home? Looking around, he found a figure in the alley to the east. He was about to yell, but when he saw who it was, he swallowed back the roar. How could it be her? The waste of the Nangong family, he let him run away a few days ago, and now he has delivered it to the door. Just as he was about to lead the servant over, he was surprised by her innocent and ignorant look like a deer. He saw her timid eyes glance at the servant, and then looked at him with watery eyes.", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}